WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:08.236
A fancy spaceship flew toward Concert Planet.

2
00:00:08.237 --> 00:00:12.303
"Guess what, Diva," her helper, Donny, said.

3
00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:16.081
"We sold all the tickets to tonight's show!"

4
00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:21.083
Diva smiled. "Everyone wants to hear me sing!"

5
00:00:21.084 --> 00:00:23.789
Boom! Something hit the spaceship.

6
00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:33.851
"Ahh!" Diva cried. "What's that?"

7
00:00:33.852 --> 00:00:41.475
"It's a cargo ship," Donny said.

8
00:00:41.476 --> 00:00:48.147
Snap! A giant claw tried to grab the ship!

9
00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:54.517
"Danger!" Diva said. "I'm in danger!"

10
00:00:54.518 --> 00:00:59.755
The claw tried to grab Diva's ship again.

11
00:00:59.756 --> 00:01:13.723
Donny flew fast.

12
00:01:13.724 --> 00:01:16.588
"We got away!" he said.

13
00:01:16.589 --> 00:01:21.445
Diva bit her lip. "What if that ship comes back?"

14
00:01:21.446 --> 00:01:29.671
"Space Patrol can help," Donny said.

15
00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:33.447
Ringo and Bot were walking down the hallway.

16
00:01:33.448 --> 00:01:36.283
Suddenly they stopped.

17
00:01:36.284 --> 00:01:40.571
"La-la-la!"

18
00:01:40.572 --> 00:01:46.104
"Who is singing?" Ringo asked.

19
00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:54.107
They followed the singing to the piano room.

20
00:01:54.108 --> 00:01:57.762
"That's Diva," Lucy whispered.

21
00:01:57.763 --> 00:02:01.293
"The most famous singer in space!"

22
00:02:01.294 --> 00:02:04.209
Lucy looked sad.

23
00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:07.809
"I wanted to go to Diva's concert tonight.

24
00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:10.142
But I couldn't get a ticket."

25
00:02:10.143 --> 00:02:11.764
Crackle!

26
00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:14.938
Captain Nova spoke over the loudspeaker.

27
00:02:14.939 --> 00:02:22.924
"Ringo and Lucy! Come to my office right now!"

